          "settings": {
            "question": "Function",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Grooming Brush: </strong>Used to clean floating hair and dander, making the hair more healthy, shiny, and soft.</li><li><strong>Electric Clipper: </strong>Used to trim the pet's hair without leaving a mess, as the hair will not fly around.</li><li><strong>Pet Paw Trimmer: </strong>Used to groom pet's paws, eyes, ears, face, and rum pair.</li><li><strong>Pet Nail Grinder: </strong>Used to groom your pet's nails.</li><li><strong>Crevice Tool: </strong>Used to clean hair on the furniture and hard-to-reach areas.</li><li><strong>Install Guide Comb: </strong>Used with electric clippers.</li></ul>"
